10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 119: DOG TURN
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR
30 POKE 53280, 0 : POKE 53281, 0 : REM BLACK

40 REM --- SPRITE POINTER SETUP ---
50 POKE 2040, 201 : REM START FACING LEFT (BLOCK 201)
60 REM (ASSUME DATA LOADED AT 12800 and 12864)

100 REM --- VIC SETUP ---
110 V = 53248
120 POKE V+21, 1 : REM ENABLE SPR 0
130 POKE V+39, 7 : REM COLOR YELLOW
140 POKE V+23, 1 : REM EXPAND Y
150 POKE V+29, 1 : REM EXPAND X
160 POKE V+1, 150 : REM Y POS

200 REM --- PHASE 1: WALK IN (LEFT) ---
210 FOR X = 345 TO 170 STEP -2
220   GOSUB 1000 : REM POSITION LOGIC
230   FOR D = 0 TO 5 : NEXT D
240 NEXT X

300 REM --- PHASE 2: PAUSE ---
310 FOR T = 0 TO 800 : NEXT T : REM LONG PAUSE

400 REM --- PHASE 3: TURN ---
410 POKE 2040, 200 : REM CHANGE POINTER TO RIGHT FACING
420 FOR T = 0 TO 300 : NEXT T : REM SHORT REACTION PAUSE

500 REM --- PHASE 4: WALK OUT (RIGHT) ---
510 FOR X = 170 TO 345 STEP 3
520   GOSUB 1000 : REM POSITION LOGIC
530   FOR D = 0 TO 5 : NEXT D
540 NEXT X

600 END

1000 REM --- X COORD & MSB LOGIC ---
1010 IF X < 256 THEN POKE V, X : POKE V+16, 0 : RETURN
1020 IF X >= 256 THEN POKE V, X-256 : POKE V+16, 1 : RETURN
